{"seq":2,"slug":"planet-diversity","title":"行星类型与多样性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/formation/planet-diversity","wordCount":1568,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"行星类型与多样性\">行星类型与多样性</h1><p>在发现系外行星之前，人类对「行星该长什么样」的全部经验只来自太阳系八颗行星。系外行星彻底颠覆了这种想象：表面温度上千度、绕恒星几天一圈的热木星，介于地球与海王星之间、太阳系里根本没有对应物的次海王星，密度低得像棉花糖的「蓬松行星」，乃至无家可归的自由漂浮行星。本节给行星世界做一次分类学梳理：主要类型、最常见却最陌生的次海王星与超级地球、把它们分开的半径鸿沟，以及这种多样性对形成理论的拷问。形成机制本身见<a href=\"formation-theory\">行星形成理论</a>，本节聚焦「形成出了哪些类型」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>系外行星可按质量/半径与轨道温度粗分为若干族群，其中最丰富的恰恰是太阳系缺席的中间地带。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[系外行星多样性] --&gt; B[气态巨行星]&#10;  A --&gt; C[次海王星与超级地球]&#10;  A --&gt; D[岩石行星]&#10;  A --&gt; E[自由漂浮行星]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[热木星 近轨道高温]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[蓬松行星 异常低密]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[半径鸿沟 把两族分开]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[太阳系无对应物 却最常见]&#10;  D --&gt; D1[超级地球与类地行星]&#10;  E --&gt; E1[不绕任何恒星 微透镜发现]\">flowchart TD\n  A[系外行星多样性] --&gt; B[气态巨行星]\n  A --&gt; C[次海王星与超级地球]\n  A --&gt; D[岩石行星]\n  A --&gt; E[自由漂浮行星]\n  B --&gt; B1[热木星 近轨道高温]\n  B --&gt; B2[蓬松行星 异常低密]\n  C --&gt; C1[半径鸿沟 把两族分开]\n  C --&gt; C2[太阳系无对应物 却最常见]\n  D --&gt; D1[超级地球与类地行星]\n  E --&gt; E1[不绕任何恒星 微透镜发现]</pre><p>下表给出主要类型的特征坐标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>典型半径</th>\n<th>典型特征</th>\n<th>太阳系对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热木星</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>J</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 1\\,R_J</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0962em;\">J</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>近轨道、高温、常膨胀</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>次海王星</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\sim4\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>含厚氢氦或水层</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超级地球</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\sim1.5\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>岩石为主、比地球大</td>\n<td>无（介于地球与海王星）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类地行星</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∼</mo><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sim 1\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>岩石、可能有薄大气</td>\n<td>地球、金星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自由漂浮行星</td>\n<td>多样</td>\n<td>不绕恒星、漂泊星际</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"热木星-第一类惊喜-至今的谜题\">热木星：第一类惊喜，至今的谜题</h2><p>人类发现的第一颗绕主序星的系外行星——飞马座 51 b——就是一颗热木星：木星质量级、轨道周期仅约 4 天、表面温度上千度。这立刻制造了一个难题：按<a href=\"formation-theory\">行星形成理论</a>，气态巨行星应在雪线之外的寒冷区形成，不可能在离恒星这么近的炽热区原位长成。唯一合理的解释是它在远处形成后<a href=\"orbital-dynamics-migration\">迁移</a>到了近轨道。</p>\n<p>热木星还展示了「半径反常」：许多热木星半径明显大于理论预期，被恒星强烈加热而膨胀，平均密度低至棉花糖量级（蓬松行星，puffy planet）。膨胀机制至今未完全厘清，候选包括恒星辐射沉积、潮汐加热、大气环流耗散等。热木星因此既是探测上的「易得品」（信号大），又是理论上的「硬骨头」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"次海王星与超级地球-最常见-却最陌生\">次海王星与超级地球：最常见，却最陌生</h2><p><a href=\"../characterization/system-architecture\">行星出现率统计</a>给出一个出人意料的结论：银河系里最常见的行星，是半径介于地球与海王星之间的次海王星与超级地球——而太阳系里恰恰没有任何一颗这样的行星。这意味着我们最熟悉的太阳系，在行星类型分布上反而是「不典型」的样本。</p>\n<p>这两族的区别远不止大小。超级地球以岩石为主、密度高，可能有薄大气；次海王星半径更大、密度低，要么裹着相当比例的氢氦包层，要么是富水的「海洋世界」。区分二者必须借助<a href=\"../characterization/mass-radius-density\">质量半径与密度</a>乃至<a href=\"../characterization/atmosphere-characterization\">大气表征</a>——同一半径下，密度与大气分子量决定它究竟是「迷你海王星」还是「放大版地球」。这种区分直接关系到它们是否可能宜居，是<a href=\"../habitability/habitable-zone\">宜居带与宜居性</a>的前置问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"半径鸿沟-演化刻下的峡谷\">半径鸿沟：演化刻下的峡谷</h2><p>把近轨道小行星按半径作直方图，会发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.5</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>R</mi><mo>⊕</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.5\\sim2\\,R_\\oplus</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2583em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">⊕</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处行星数量明显偏少，形成一道把超级地球与次海王星清晰分开的「峡谷」——半径鸿沟（radius valley）。这不是测量偏差，而是行星演化的真实印记，是连接行星类型与演化史的关键观测。</p>\n<p>主流解释是大气逃逸。一颗带薄氢氦包层的小行星，若离恒星太近，包层会被剥离，留下裸露的岩石核（落在鸿沟下方的超级地球一侧）；若包层够厚或离得够远，则保住包层（落在鸿沟上方的次海王星一侧）。剥离机制有两类竞争假说：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>光致蒸发</mtext><mo>:</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>M</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mo>∝</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>核能驱动逃逸</mtext><mo>:</mo><mtext>靠核冷却的内热驱散包层</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{光致蒸发}: \\dot{M} \\propto \\frac{L_{\\rm XUV}}{a^2}, \\qquad \\text{核能驱动逃逸}: \\text{靠核冷却的内热驱散包层}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">光致蒸发</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9202em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0556em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">XUV</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">核能驱动逃逸</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">靠核冷却的内热驱散包层</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>光致蒸发靠恒星 X 射线/极紫外辐射加热并吹散大气；核能驱动逃逸（core-powered mass loss）则靠行星核形成后残留的内热从内部驱散包层。两者都能产出半径鸿沟，区分它们需要看鸿沟位置随恒星年龄、轨道距离的精细变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多样性对理论的拷问\">多样性对理论的拷问</h2><p>系外行星的类型谱系，是对任何形成理论的硬约束：一个合格的理论不仅要能造出木星和地球，还必须自然地解释为什么次海王星最常见、为什么存在半径鸿沟、为什么热木星会出现在不该出现的地方、为什么会有大量不绕任何恒星的自由漂浮行星（多由<a href=\"../detection/imaging-microlensing\">微引力透镜</a>发现，可能是形成后被引力弹射出系统的遗孤）。</p>\n<p>换言之，多样性把「形成」「迁移」「演化（大气逃逸）」三条线索拧成一股：一颗行星的最终面貌，是它在哪里形成、如何迁移、又被恒星辐射如何改造的综合结果。理解多样性，就是理解这三条线索如何在每颗行星身上交织——这也是本章三篇文档共同回答的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>系外行星的类型远超太阳系经验：热木星、次海王星、超级地球、蓬松行星、自由漂浮行星各成一族。</li>\n<li>热木星不可能原位形成，证明了<a href=\"orbital-dynamics-migration\">迁移</a>的普遍存在，其半径膨胀至今是未解之谜。</li>\n<li>银河系最常见的次海王星与超级地球在太阳系完全缺席，区分二者需<a href=\"../characterization/mass-radius-density\">密度</a>与<a href=\"../characterization/atmosphere-characterization\">大气</a>数据。</li>\n<li>半径鸿沟由大气逃逸（光致蒸发或核能驱动逃逸）刻下，把两族小行星清晰分开，是演化的真实印记。</li>\n<li>行星多样性是对形成理论的硬约束，把形成、<a href=\"orbital-dynamics-migration\">迁移</a>与演化三条线索拧在一起。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"行星类型与多样性","id":"行星类型与多样性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"热木星：第一类惊喜，至今的谜题","id":"热木星-第一类惊喜-至今的谜题"},{"level":2,"text":"次海王星与超级地球：最常见，却最陌生","id":"次海王星与超级地球-最常见-却最陌生"},{"level":2,"text":"半径鸿沟：演化刻下的峡谷","id":"半径鸿沟-演化刻下的峡谷"},{"level":2,"text":"多样性对理论的拷问","id":"多样性对理论的拷问"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"行星形成理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/formation/formation-theory"},"next":{"title":"轨道动力学与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/exoplanets/formation/orbital-dynamics-migration"}}